sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: A message with <Configured_State> is configured

    CSMS->>CS: GetDisplayMessagesRequest (state = <Configured_State>, requestId = <Generated Id>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: state must be <Configured_State><br>priority must be omitted<br>id must be omitted<br>requestId must be <Generated Id>
    CS-->>CSMS: GetDisplayMessagesResponse (status = Accepted)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyDisplayMessagesRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyDisplayMessagesResponse
